 ],
 "description": "The First 14 SE – Seascape Edition delivers the excitement, speed and fun of high-performance racing skiffs in a modern, accessible, safe and really easy-to-handle sport dinghy. The build quality and the high-tech materials allow you to push the boat in stronger winds, while excessive sail area empowers the sailor in light wind conditions. With smart removable wheels and easy transport on the car-roof, she is the perfect answer to an active lifestyle.\nConcept & R&D : Seascape",
